{"title":"Grumms Knuckle Warmace","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Grumm The Hill King</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      <p><b class=\"uq-tag\">Unique.</b> Dropped by <a href=\"#/npc/grumm-the-hill-king\">Grumm the Hill King</a> on <b>2%</b> of kills (<b>10%</b> from an elite). Built on <a href=\"#/item/gold-warmace\">Gold Warmace</a>. Unique items can’t be reforged.</p><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>+4% damage for each hit in a row on the same target, up to +20%.</li></ul><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a> for all of them.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-king\" title=\"Grumm The Hill King - Normal, 20.0% of recorded drops (1 / 5 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/2d79090579fad662adeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Grumm The Hill King</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20.0%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"grumms-knuckle-warmace\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/b2488c3b878505e36b9e.svg\" alt=\"Grumms Knuckle Warmace\"></div><h3>Grumms Knuckle Warmace</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/14/2026, 9:53:15 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}